Mi na djica lo nu kurki (I don't want to be disagreeable) (*I think I
got that right anyway*)

but I think the name should be spelled, rai.yn. Otherwise, according
to the rules of lojban pronunciation, you would need to form a
tripthong (combine the vowel sounds) and there aren't any tripthongs
in lojban, so it would be even more difficult.




